{"4215690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dreamstory", "steam_appid": 4215690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Every Dream begins with a Wish.. A living creature's desires made manifest.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But God hated the idea of anyone else being able to grant wishes, so he split the world into two.. one of Wishes and one of Dreams!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dreamstory</strong> is a Story heavy, Psychological Horror, 3D Turn-Based RPG with mechanics similar to <strong>Undertale</strong> &amp; <strong>Paper Mario</strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll play as a newcomer to the Realm of Dreams named Priscilla who was wished into existence to save the world..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a beautiful <strong>3D</strong> world based on the magical Realm of Dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215690/extras/989390a01fb9bde24ebc8d7ef367a5a8.poster.avif?t=1765582434\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215690/extras/989390a01fb9bde24ebc8d7ef367a5a8.webm?t=1765582434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215690/extras/989390a01fb9bde24ebc8d7ef367a5a8.mp4?t=1765582434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight <strong>Turn-based battles</strong> mixed with <strong>minigames</strong> and <strong>bullet hell</strong> segments, use Priscilla's unique <strong>mimic</strong> ability to copy enemy abilities and turn the nightmares powers against them! Hundreds of abilities to copy, lots of status effects.. be careful what you choose!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215690/extras/19487d532ca5a5db5f9578c2c52af4fe.poster.avif?t=1765582434\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215690/extras/19487d532ca5a5db5f9578c2c52af4fe.webm?t=1765582434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215690/extras/19487d532ca5a5db5f9578c2c52af4fe.mp4?t=1765582434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy puzzles, platforming and meet a plethora of interesting and unique characters based on the dreams of living creatures. (<strong>With animated cinematics!</strong>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215690/extras/74baaf35d7cf992687b38c0070cf52c2.poster.avif?t=1765582434\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215690/extras/74baaf35d7cf992687b38c0070cf52c2.webm?t=1765582434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215690/extras/74baaf35d7cf992687b38c0070cf52c2.mp4?t=1765582434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the secrets behind the stitches that hold this reality together, answer the prayer of a monster and become the only hope for the Realm of Dreams.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Every Dream begins with a Wish.. A living creature's desires made manifest.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But God hated the idea of anyone else being able to grant wishes, so he split the world into two.. one of Wishes and one of Dreams!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dreamstory</strong> is a Story heavy, Psychological Horror, 3D Turn-Based RPG with mechanics similar to <strong>Undertale</strong> &amp; <strong>Paper Mario</strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll play as a newcomer to the Realm of Dreams named Priscilla who was wished into existence to save the world..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a beautiful <strong>3D</strong> world based on the magical Realm of Dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215690/extras/989390a01fb9bde24ebc8d7ef367a5a8.poster.avif?t=1765582434\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215690/extras/989390a01fb9bde24ebc8d7ef367a5a8.webm?t=1765582434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215690/extras/989390a01fb9bde24ebc8d7ef367a5a8.mp4?t=1765582434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight <strong>Turn-based battles</strong> mixed with <strong>minigames</strong> and <strong>bullet hell</strong> segments, use Priscilla's unique <strong>mimic</strong> ability to copy enemy abilities and turn the nightmares powers against them! Hundreds of abilities to copy, lots of status effects.. be careful what you choose!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215690/extras/19487d532ca5a5db5f9578c2c52af4fe.poster.avif?t=1765582434\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215690/extras/19487d532ca5a5db5f9578c2c52af4fe.webm?t=1765